# Garden repos

The Trunk (`the-trunk`) holds **skills, rules, `apps.json`, and the dashboard**. App source and ideas do **not** live here.

| Kind | On disk (from trunk) | GitHub (private) |
|------|----------------------|------------------|
| Sprouts | `../the-sprouts/<slug>/` | `naguibihab/the-sprouts` |
| Limb | `../limb-<slug>/` | `naguibihab/limb-<slug>` |
| Sapling | `../the-saplings/<site>/` | saplings repo |

`apps.json`:

- Sprout **`description`**: `../the-sprouts/<slug>/brief.md`
- Limb **`limbPath`**: `../limb-<slug>`
- Conversation **`path`**: `../limb-<slug>/the-conversation/...`

Resolve those paths from the trunk working directory. Dashboard URLs map `/garden/<repo>/...`, `/sprouts/...`, and `/limbs/limb-...` onto those siblings.

Do not add a new sprout or limb folder under this repo. Do not point Netlify at the trunk.
